# Room entities, DAOs, and the database are referenced by generated code. Room ships
# consumer rules; these attributes preserve generic metadata used by its adapters.
-keepattributes Signature,InnerClasses,EnclosingMethod

# Biweekly discovers some property scribes reflectively and carries a broad component model.
-keep class biweekly.** { *; }
-dontwarn biweekly.**
